   "text": "HOW FAST (target)\n\nNew post, reply, edit:  within 30 seconds\nDelete:  within 30 seconds (handled first)\nMember removed:  within 30 s + checked again before every private answer\nNew or changed file:  within 5 minutes\nMeeting transcript:  within 5 minutes after Teams publishes it\nAnything missed:  fixed by the nightly check",
   "originalText": "HOW FAST (target)\n\nNew post, reply, edit:  within 30 seconds\nDelete:  within 30 seconds (handled first)\nMember removed:  within 30 s + checked again before every private answer\nNew or changed file:  within 5 minutes\nMeeting transcript:  within 5 minutes after Teams publishes it\nAnything missed:  fixed by the nightly check",
