   "text": "WHAT MAX PROMISES (honestly)\n\nOnce Max knows something was edited or deleted,\nthe old text never appears again.\n\nMax always knows how far behind each chat is,\nand says so if it matters.\n\nA nightly check proves the copy matches Teams.",
